  <li id="thy-r1">G. S. Collins, H. J. Melosh, R. A. Marcus: “Earth Impact Effects Program”, <i>Meteoritics &amp; Planetary Science</i> 40 (2005)</li>
  <li id="thy-r2">Y. Hu et al.: “A Moving Least Squares Material Point Method with Displacement Discontinuity and Two-Way Rigid Body Coupling”, <i>ACM Trans. Graphics</i> 37 (2018)</li>
  <li id="thy-r3">J. H. Tillotson: “Metallic Equations of State for Hypervelocity Impact”, General Atomic Report GA-3216 (1962)</li>
  <li id="thy-r4">H. J. Melosh: <i>Impact Cratering: A Geologic Process</i>, Oxford University Press (1989)。W. Benz, E. Asphaug: “Catastrophic Disruptions Revisited”, <i>Icarus</i> 142 (1999)</li>
  <li id="thy-r5">G. S. Collins, H. J. Melosh, B. A. Ivanov: “Modeling damage and deformation in impact simulations”, <i>Meteoritics &amp; Planetary Science</i> 39 (2004)</li>
  <li id="thy-r6">K. Wünnemann, B. A. Ivanov: “Numerical modelling of the impact crater depth–diameter dependence in an acoustically fluidized target”, <i>Planetary and Space Science</i> 51 (2003)</li>
  <li id="thy-r7">P. Schenk et al.: “Compositional control on impact crater formation on mid-sized planetary bodies”, <i>Icarus</i> 359 (2021)</li>
  <li id="thy-r8">J. E. Richardson: “Cratering saturation and equilibrium”, <i>Icarus</i> 204 (2009)</li>
  <li id="thy-r9">K. R. Housen, K. A. Holsapple: “Ejecta from impact craters”, <i>Icarus</i> 211 (2011)</li>
